Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.02,Dialogue,chptr,0,0,0,,{Intro}
Comment: 0,0:02:54.32,0:02:54.36,Dialogue,chptr,0,0,0,,{Episod}
Comment: 0,0:28:35.24,0:28:35.28,Dialogue,chptr,0,0,0,,{ED}
Comment: 99,0:00:17.04,0:00:19.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Familia mea a fost \Nmereu una complicată.
Comment: 99,0:00:19.75,0:00:20.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yuu!
Comment: 99,0:00:21.42,0:00:23.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Azi e o zi importantă pentru sora ta!
Comment: 99,0:00:23.92,0:00:24.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yuu—
Comment: 99,0:00:24.42,0:00:25.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sărut-mâna pentru masă.
Comment: 99,0:00:25.84,0:00:27.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu mai mănânci?
Comment: 99,0:00:27.22,0:00:29.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu. Trebuie să pornesc.
Comment: 99,0:00:29.55,0:00:32.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ceaiul făcut de tine \Neste cel mai bun, mamă.
Comment: 99,0:00:35.43,0:00:37.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nu au știut niciodată cum \Nsă se comporte în preajma mea.
Comment: 99,0:00:38.18,0:00:41.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mama nu a putut niciodată să mă privească \Nîn ochi în momentele importante, cum e acesta.
Comment: 99,0:00:41.90,0:00:42.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hana...
Comment: 99,0:00:45.28,0:00:47.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dă tot ce poți pentru {\i1}tine{\i0}, bine?
Comment: 99,0:00:48.28,0:00:52.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Tata mereu se freacă la \Nnas atunci când minte.
Comment: 99,0:00:52.16,0:00:54.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Desigur, la fel ca întotdeauna.
Comment: 99,0:00:55.74,0:00:56.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ne vedem mai târziu.
Comment: 99,0:00:58.04,0:01:00.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Iar fratele meu, Yuuto...
Comment: 99,0:01:00.87,0:01:02.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}încă n-a învățat să mintă.
Comment: 99,0:01:04.54,0:01:07.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Aceasta este familia mea.
Comment: 99,0:01:07.09,0:01:09.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Suntem o familie ciudată.
Comment: 99,0:01:11.55,0:01:13.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Dar îmi doresc cu adevărat...
Comment: 99,0:01:13.43,0:01:15.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}să-i protejez.
Comment: 99,0:01:25.15,0:01:30.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Dimineața asta mi-a adus aminte de ziua \Ncând am luat examenul de admitere la liceu.
Comment: 99,0:01:30.99,0:01:35.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mama și tata erau chiar \Nmai emoționați decât mine.
Comment: 99,0:01:39.83,0:01:42.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Trăim într-o lume atât de crudă...
Comment: 99,0:01:42.50,0:01:45.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}O lume în care unii sunt \Ncei aleși, iar alții nu.
Comment: 99,0:01:45.88,0:01:50.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}O lume în care unii \Nau noroc, iar alții nu.
Comment: 99,0:01:50.72,0:01:52.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Am primit rezultatul. E {\i1}negru{\i0}.
Comment: 99,0:01:52.30,0:01:55.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mare păcat. Chiar era chipeș.
Comment: 99,0:01:55.09,0:01:58.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Și nu e nevoie de prea mult ca să \Najungi de o parte sau de cealaltă.
Comment: 99,0:02:00.10,0:02:01.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Îmi pare rău.
Comment: 99,0:02:03.52,0:02:04.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Țintă eliminată.
Comment: 99,0:02:05.61,0:02:08.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Rezultatul celeilalte persoane \Nva veni tot astăzi, nu?
Comment: 99,0:02:08.15,0:02:10.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Va fi prima ei misiune, nu?
Comment: 99,0:02:10.11,0:02:12.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sper să fie {\i1}alb{\i0}.
Comment: 99,0:02:13.07,0:02:17.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Și chiar dacă sunt de \Npartea celor „aleși”,
Comment: 99,0:02:17.16,0:02:21.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}nu m-am considerat \Nniciodată norocoasă.
Comment: 99,0:02:23.08,0:02:25.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oare vom reuși s-o găsim astăzi?
Comment: 99,0:02:26.17,0:02:28.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Pe persoana pe care o \Ncăutăm de atâta timp:
Comment: 99,0:02:29.46,0:02:31.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}ultima noastră speranță.
Comment: 99,0:02:38.30,0:02:40.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ești bine, domnișoară Tougetsu?
Comment: 99,0:02:40.60,0:02:41.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,D-Da!
Comment: 99,0:02:41.77,0:02:42.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Voi ieși imediat.
Comment: 99,0:02:43.14,0:02:45.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu ai de ce să fii emoționată.
Comment: 99,0:02:45.35,0:02:46.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vă veți împrieteni repede.
Comment: 99,0:02:54.90,0:02:56.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Eu sunt Tougetsu Hana.
Comment: 99,0:02:56.78,0:02:58.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mă bucur să vă cunosc.
Comment: 99,0:02:59.03,0:03:03.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Serviciul tatălui ei îi obligă \Nsă se mute destul de des,
Comment: 99,0:03:03.87,0:03:07.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,de asta s-a transferat în acest \Nmoment al anului școlar.
Comment: 99,0:03:07.63,0:03:09.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Să fiți drăguți cu ea, bine?
Comment: 99,0:03:09.46,0:03:11.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bine.
Comment: 99,0:03:13.92,0:03:15.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce naiba se petrece aici?
Comment: 99,0:03:15.80,0:03:17.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Trafic la ora asta?
Comment: 99,0:03:17.14,0:03:18.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,La naiba.
Comment: 99,0:03:25.81,0:03:26.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hana, Hana!
Comment: 99,0:03:27.02,0:03:27.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bună,
Comment: 99,0:03:27.90,0:03:29.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,vrei să iei prânzul cu noi?
Comment: 99,0:03:29.27,0:03:30.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hei! Dispari!
Comment: 99,0:03:30.36,0:03:32.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Băieții au interdicție!
Comment: 99,0:03:32.15,0:03:34.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce? Sunteți cumva geloase?
Comment: 99,0:03:33.82,0:03:34.99,Dialogue Overlap,,0,0,0,,Poftim?!
Comment: 99,0:03:34.99,0:03:36.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fii prost în altă parte!
Comment: 99,0:03:36.36,0:03:38.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu prea avem parte de elevi noi \Nîn această perioadă a anului.
Comment: 99,0:03:38.74,0:03:40.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Asta e uniforma de \Nla vechea ta școală?
Comment: 99,0:03:40.99,0:03:43.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fetelor nu le plac băieții {\i1}prea{\i0} băgăcioși.
Comment: 99,0:03:43.37,0:03:44.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce? Pe bune?
Comment: 99,0:03:44.83,0:03:45.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Da, de asta...
Comment: 99,0:03:45.25,0:03:45.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Hei!
Comment: 99,0:03:46.50,0:03:48.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Pare că se întâmplă ceva important.
Comment: 99,0:03:48.37,0:03:49.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce vrei să spui?
Comment: 99,0:03:49.79,0:03:52.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Au fost închise toate drumurile \Nce permit accesul pe insulă.
Comment: 99,0:03:52.42,0:03:54.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,De ce ar face una ca asta?
Comment: 99,0:03:57.09,0:03:59.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vă rog să așteptați aici.
Comment: 99,0:04:05.48,0:04:07.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}0-6, aici 0-0.
Comment: 99,0:04:08.39,0:04:09.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Recepționez.
Comment: 99,0:04:09.65,0:04:11.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Am vești proaste.
Comment: 99,0:04:11.31,0:04:15.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}În câteva minute, \Nlocația ta va fi atacată.
Comment: 99,0:04:14.36,0:04:16.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Lucrurile devin interesante!
Comment: 99,0:04:15.19,0:04:17.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}A durat prea mult ca \Nsă spargem criptarea.
Comment: 99,0:04:17.86,0:04:18.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nu mai avem timp.
Comment: 99,0:04:19.11,0:04:20.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Analiza nu s-a finalizat încă.
Comment: 99,0:04:20.49,0:04:23.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Trebuie să pleci cu \Nținta imediat de acolo.
Comment: 99,0:04:23.16,0:04:25.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Raportează imediat cum ați \Najuns într-o zonă sigură.
Comment: 99,0:04:25.50,0:04:26.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}0-0, terminat.
Comment: 99,0:04:28.54,0:04:31.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Toată lumea spune online că \Nsunt elicoptere peste tot. Uite!
Comment: 99,0:04:30.42,0:04:32.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hei, Tougetsu...
Comment: 99,0:04:33.46,0:04:34.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tougetsu?
Comment: 99,0:04:37.76,0:04:39.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,C-Ce?
Comment: 99,0:04:41.22,0:04:43.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vino cu mine.
Comment: 99,0:04:43.22,0:04:43.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce?
Comment: 99,0:04:47.39,0:04:48.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,H-Hei!
Comment: 99,0:04:48.73,0:04:49.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Unde mergem?
Comment: 99,0:04:52.90,0:04:54.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dă-mi drumul!
Comment: 99,0:04:55.40,0:04:57.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce te-a apucat?
Comment: 99,0:04:57.44,0:04:59.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Să nu te îndepărtezi de mine.
Comment: 99,0:04:59.24,0:04:59.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce?
Comment: 99,0:05:00.74,0:05:02.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Altfel...
Comment: 99,0:05:02.45,0:05:03.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,vei muri.
Comment: 99,0:05:04.91,0:05:06.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce tot spui acolo?
Comment: 99,0:05:41.07,0:05:41.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Pe aici!
Comment: 99,0:05:42.16,0:05:43.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,H-Hei!
Comment: 99,0:06:24.20,0:06:25.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Liber!
Comment: 99,0:06:25.24,0:06:26.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Liber!
Comment: 99,0:06:26.78,0:06:28.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Inamic doborât! \NÎl vom scoate afară.
Comment: 99,0:06:31.91,0:06:33.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,La naiba!
Comment: 99,0:06:33.41,0:06:35.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,0-0, aici 0-6.
Comment: 99,0:06:35.33,0:06:37.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ținta a fost securizată.
Comment: 99,0:06:37.00,0:06:38.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dar suntem blocați înăuntru—
Comment: 99,0:06:37.96,0:06:38.96,Dialogue Overlap,,0,0,0,,{\i1}0-6!
Comment: 99,0:06:39.21,0:06:41.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Am descoperit obiectivul inamicului.
Comment: 99,0:06:41.88,0:06:44.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Caută un cobai de laborator \Nevadat pe nume „P”.
Comment: 99,0:06:44.59,0:06:46.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}După ce-l vor găsi pe acest P, \Nvor ridica ușile metalice.
Comment: 99,0:06:46.93,0:06:50.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Alăturați-vă celorlalți elevi \Nși evacuați-vă împreună cu ei.
Comment: 99,0:06:50.68,0:06:52.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Folosiți ruta {\i0}Bravo{\i1}.
Comment: 99,0:06:52.23,0:06:54.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Un elicopter vă va prelua de \Nla punctul de extracție {\i0}Echo{\i1}.
Comment: 99,0:06:54.69,0:06:57.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Chiar e bine să acționăm astfel? \NÎncă nu-i știm culoarea.
Comment: 99,0:06:57.94,0:06:59.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Tocmai am primit rezultatul.
Comment: 99,0:06:59.86,0:07:01.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Este {\i1}alb{\i0}.
Comment: 99,0:07:01.40,0:07:02.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Vino aici împreună cu ținta.
Comment: 99,0:07:02.57,0:07:03.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hei.
Comment: 99,0:07:03.70,0:07:05.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce tot șușotești aco—
Comment: 99,0:07:06.61,0:07:08.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,H-Hei...
Comment: 99,0:07:08.07,0:07:09.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce ușurare...
Comment: 99,0:07:11.49,0:07:14.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,S-ar putea ca tu să fii \Nultima noastră speranță.
Comment: 99,0:07:15.00,0:07:15.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Poftim?
Comment: 99,0:07:19.29,0:07:20.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Aici colonelul Amagata...
Comment: 99,0:07:20.63,0:07:23.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Interceptăm mai mult din \Ncomunicațiile americanilor.
Comment: 99,0:07:23.30,0:07:24.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ceva pare să fi mers prost.
Comment: 99,0:07:24.76,0:07:28.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Comunicațiile lor cu baza au devenit haotice, \Nde parcă ar fi într-o stare de panică.
Comment: 99,0:07:40.40,0:07:41.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce a fost asta?
Comment: 99,0:07:41.15,0:07:42.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,0-0, aici 0-6.
Comment: 99,0:07:42.82,0:07:44.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce se întâmplă?
Comment: 99,0:07:44.11,0:07:45.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}0-6, aici 0-0.
Comment: 99,0:07:45.86,0:07:46.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Avem o problemă.
Comment: 99,0:07:47.57,0:07:50.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Cobaiul de laborator pe \Nnume P s-a pandoralizat.
Comment: 99,0:07:50.12,0:07:52.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Soldații americani au \Nînceput să evacueze elevii.
Comment: 99,0:07:52.37,0:07:54.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Apoi vor... Pandora...
Comment: 99,0:07:54.87,0:07:58.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...acum... Repet...
Comment: 99,0:07:58.21,0:08:00.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,0-0, nu am recepționat nimic!
Comment: 99,0:08:00.63,0:08:02.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vă rog să repetați!
Comment: 99,0:08:02.05,0:08:03.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dle colonel...
Comment: 99,0:08:03.17,0:08:05.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dle colonel Amagata?!
Comment: 99,0:08:05.63,0:08:09.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dragi elevi, vă rugăm să \Ncooperați cu soldații și profesorii
Comment: 99,0:08:09.22,0:08:11.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,și mergeți pe terenul de sport.
Comment: 99,0:08:11.39,0:08:13.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Am pierdut legătura cu 0-6.
Comment: 99,0:08:13.47,0:08:15.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Folosesc ECM-uri pentru a ne bruia!
Comment: 99,0:08:15.02,0:08:18.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Chiar și sateliții de \Nsupraveghere sunt afectați.
Comment: 99,0:08:18.27,0:08:19.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Unde este 0-3?
Comment: 99,0:08:20.06,0:08:21.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tocmai se întoarce \Ndin misiune, domnule.
Comment: 99,0:08:21.69,0:08:23.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bun. Pregătiți-o pentru încă una.
Comment: 99,0:08:23.61,0:08:26.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dar nu au trecut nici măcar 12 ore de la ultima misiune și este rănită!
Comment: 99,0:08:26.95,0:08:30.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vom risca să se pandoralizeze și ea dacă \No supunem unui stres genomic excesiv.
Comment: 99,0:08:32.24,0:08:33.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Pandora...
Comment: 99,0:08:34.12,0:08:37.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,„Lumina umanității”... \Nsau cel puțin asta am crezut.
Comment: 99,0:08:42.04,0:08:44.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vă rugăm să rămâneți calm \Nși să urcați în camioane!
Comment: 99,0:08:44.50,0:08:46.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vă mulțumim!
Comment: 99,0:08:49.84,0:08:51.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fir-ar. Nu avem semnal deloc.
Comment: 99,0:08:57.14,0:08:58.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,De ce?!
Comment: 99,0:08:58.56,0:09:00.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ar trebui să ne evacuăm \Nalături de ceilalți!
Comment: 99,0:09:00.90,0:09:02.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu putem face asta...
Comment: 99,0:09:02.48,0:09:03.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,De ce?
Comment: 99,0:09:03.11,0:09:06.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Deoarece soldații \Nte caută și pe tine.
Comment: 99,0:09:06.65,0:09:07.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Și pe mine?
Comment: 99,0:09:07.32,0:09:08.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stați pe loc!
Comment: 99,0:09:12.24,0:09:15.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Aici India 2-5, raportez. \NAm găsit doi elevi rămași în urmă.
Comment: 99,0:09:15.99,0:09:19.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Le vom verifica legitimațiile și...
Comment: 99,0:09:16.87,0:09:19.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ne puteți arăta legitimațiile?
Comment: 99,0:09:20.29,0:09:22.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Da, desigur.
Comment: 99,0:09:23.79,0:09:25.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mulțumesc.
Comment: 99,0:09:25.00,0:09:26.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Și tu, domnișoară.
Comment: 99,0:09:29.42,0:09:30.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce naib—
Comment: 99,0:09:44.06,0:09:46.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Este... o Floare...
Comment: 99,0:09:52.91,0:09:53.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,În spatele tău!
Comment: 99,0:10:08.67,0:10:11.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Te rog, trebuie să vii cu mine.
Comment: 99,0:10:13.26,0:10:14.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Te rog!
Comment: 99,0:10:15.30,0:10:17.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Am găsit toți elevii?
Comment: 99,0:10:17.26,0:10:19.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu, domnule. Încă lipsesc doi.
Comment: 99,0:10:20.52,0:10:22.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce? Acest băiat...
Comment: 99,0:10:22.73,0:10:26.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Aici India 6-4, raportez. \NIndia 2-5 a fost doborât!
Comment: 99,0:10:26.19,0:10:27.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Avem de a face cu o Floare!
Comment: 99,0:10:27.36,0:10:28.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,O Floare?!
Comment: 99,0:10:28.32,0:10:29.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu știm care e.
Comment: 99,0:10:29.48,0:10:31.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Avem nevoie de întăriri!
Comment: 99,0:10:31.03,0:10:32.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,La naiba cu Asupriții!
Comment: 99,0:10:32.57,0:10:34.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce naiba caută aici?
Comment: 99,0:10:34.53,0:10:37.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dacă unul este o Floare, \Natunci celălalt e...
Comment: 99,0:10:38.70,0:10:40.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Avem nevoie de \Nsprijin aerian imediat!
Comment: 99,0:10:40.29,0:10:43.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Eliminați-l pe cel periculos și \Naduceți-l în viață pe celălalt!
Comment: 99,0:11:18.87,0:11:20.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce naib—
Comment: 99,0:11:35.26,0:11:38.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,C-Ce naiba e acel monstru?
Comment: 99,0:11:38.47,0:11:39.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Un Pandora.
Comment: 99,0:11:45.69,0:11:47.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stai în spatele meu!
Comment: 99,0:11:59.78,0:12:01.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Delicios!
Comment: 99,0:12:01.74,0:12:04.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cum poți mânca după \N{\i1}tot{\i} ce s-a întâmplat?
Comment: 99,0:12:04.04,0:12:06.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mă scuzați, aș mai dori o prăjitură.
Comment: 99,0:12:07.79,0:12:09.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Din cauza a {\i1}tot{\i0} ce s-a întâmplat \Nam nevoie de prăjituri.
Comment: 99,0:12:18.26,0:12:19.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,0-2, recepționat.
Comment: 99,0:12:19.93,0:12:21.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,0-8, recepționat.
Comment: 99,0:12:22.93,0:12:24.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Pornim?
Comment: 99,0:12:25.14,0:12:27.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,O operațiune în \Ndesfășurare la un liceu?
Comment: 99,0:12:27.69,0:12:31.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Au izolat zona cu \Najutorul poliției locale.
Comment: 99,0:12:31.48,0:12:35.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,E vorba de trupele speciale care \Nau venit acum 6 luni în Japonia.
Comment: 99,0:12:35.36,0:12:39.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bănuim că vor să-l găsească pe cobaiul \Nde laborator evadat pe nume „P”.
Comment: 99,0:12:39.91,0:12:41.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Și...
Comment: 99,0:12:41.49,0:12:44.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Am aflat, de asemenea, \Ncă o Floare se află în acel loc.
Comment: 99,0:12:45.50,0:12:49.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu implica niște copii în asta, Amagata.
Comment: 99,0:12:51.83,0:12:54.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Pentru un exercițiu militar, \Nchiar pare foarte real.
Comment: 99,0:12:54.46,0:12:57.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sunt vremuri periculoase.
Comment: 99,0:12:57.09,0:12:59.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,X-ray 6-4 către bază. \NCare este situația?
Comment: 99,0:12:59.43,0:13:02.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Baza către X-ray 6-4. \NPandora încă nu s-a mișcat.
Comment: 99,0:13:02.51,0:13:05.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,X-ray 3-2 și X-ray 4-2 \Nau contact vizual.
Comment: 99,0:13:05.77,0:13:08.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Recepționat. Mențineți contactul \Nvizual până la noi ordine.
Comment: 99,0:13:16.11,0:13:17.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hei...
Comment: 99,0:13:17.57,0:13:18.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ești în regulă?
Comment: 99,0:13:20.57,0:13:23.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,D-Da... sunt.
Comment: 99,0:13:23.45,0:13:24.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,E clar că nu ești!
Comment: 99,0:13:37.26,0:13:39.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Poți să te uiți în altă parte?
Comment: 99,0:13:39.05,0:13:40.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bine.
Comment: 99,0:13:55.23,0:13:56.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Te poți întoarce acum.
Comment: 99,0:13:58.48,0:14:01.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Am luat un ser. Ar trebui să \Nmă stabilizeze pentru moment.
Comment: 99,0:14:02.11,0:14:04.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cum te cheamă?
Comment: 99,0:14:05.41,0:14:07.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,M-am prezentat chiar azi-dimineață.
Comment: 99,0:14:10.16,0:14:11.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tougetsu.
Comment: 99,0:14:11.62,0:14:13.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tougetsu Hana.
Comment: 99,0:14:13.29,0:14:15.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hana, nu?
Comment: 99,0:14:15.63,0:14:16.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Eu sunt Nanase...
Comment: 99,0:14:16.96,0:14:18.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shunichi, nu?
Comment: 99,0:14:19.63,0:14:20.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,De unde știi?
Comment: 99,0:14:21.59,0:14:24.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Știu asta de mult timp.
Comment: 99,0:14:24.01,0:14:26.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cu mult timp înainte de ziua asta.
Comment: 99,0:14:35.10,0:14:37.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Zona e liberă. Să mergem.
Comment: 99,0:14:47.41,0:14:48.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hei...
Comment: 99,0:14:48.95,0:14:50.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,legat de ce ai spus mai devreme...
Comment: 99,0:14:50.29,0:14:53.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,că sunt speranța ta \Nsau ceva de genul...
Comment: 99,0:14:53.16,0:14:55.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,La ce te refereai?
Comment: 99,0:14:56.13,0:14:59.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Există o grupare de \Nasasini numită „Flori”.
Comment: 99,0:14:59.05,0:15:00.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A-Asasini?
Comment: 99,0:15:01.67,0:15:04.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A fost ales acest nume deoarece \Nflorile se ofilesc și-și pierd petalele.
Comment: 99,0:15:04.72,0:15:06.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,E un nume oribil dacă \Nstai puțin să te gândești.
Comment: 99,0:15:07.47,0:15:10.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Și eu fac parte din această \Ngrupare. Sunt o Floare.
Comment: 99,0:15:11.02,0:15:12.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shunichi...
Comment: 99,0:15:12.68,0:15:15.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Unde sunt părinții tăi?
Comment: 99,0:15:16.35,0:15:17.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,De ce mă întrebi?
Comment: 99,0:15:18.31,0:15:21.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Îți iubești părinții?
Comment: 99,0:15:22.78,0:15:24.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu prea știu.
Comment: 99,0:15:25.03,0:15:29.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Când eram mic, tata a \Nplecat și nu s-a mai întors.
Comment: 99,0:15:30.58,0:15:31.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,De parcă ar fi dispărut.
Comment: 99,0:15:32.87,0:15:34.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mama mi-a spus:
Comment: 99,0:15:34.08,0:15:37.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,„Tatăl tău lucrează la ceva \Nfoarte important pentru tine.”
Comment: 99,0:15:37.71,0:15:39.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Îi lua mereu apărarea.
Comment: 99,0:15:39.46,0:15:43.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cred că aș fi preferat să-mi fi spus pur \Nși simplu că a plecat cu o altă femeie.
Comment: 99,0:15:43.80,0:15:46.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu ai de unde să știi asta...
Comment: 99,0:15:46.72,0:15:50.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Poate chiar muncește \Ndin greu... pentru tine.
Comment: 99,0:15:50.18,0:15:51.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mă îndoiesc...
Comment: 99,0:15:51.56,0:15:55.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu fac asta pentru că vreau.
Comment: 99,0:15:55.10,0:15:55.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce?
Comment: 99,0:15:55.89,0:15:57.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Atunci când eram pe scări...
Comment: 99,0:15:57.44,0:15:59.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,nu am vrut să-l omor.
Comment: 99,0:15:59.65,0:16:01.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dar dacă nu urmez ordinele,
Comment: 99,0:16:01.44,0:16:04.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,mama și tata vor...
Comment: 99,0:16:02.32,0:16:03.23,Dialogue Overlap,,0,0,0,,Hei!
Comment: 99,0:16:07.28,0:16:09.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Soarta noastră se află...
Comment: 99,0:16:09.70,0:16:12.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,în mâinile unui băiat de 16 ani.
Comment: 99,0:16:12.24,0:16:14.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Membrii mai vechi spuneau mereu:
Comment: 99,0:16:14.33,0:16:16.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,„El este singura noastră \Nsperanță”, înainte să moară.
Comment: 99,0:16:16.83,0:16:17.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Te referi la mine?
Comment: 99,0:16:18.75,0:16:20.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shunichi,
Comment: 99,0:16:20.42,0:16:23.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,s-ar putea ca tu să fii singurul \Ncare ne poate elibera de...
Comment: 99,0:16:23.00,0:16:24.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,acest blestem.
Comment: 99,0:16:32.85,0:16:34.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oare fata asta chiar e...
Comment: 99,0:16:34.77,0:16:36.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,o asasină?
Comment: 99,0:16:50.45,0:16:51.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu mișca!
Comment: 99,0:16:53.54,0:16:55.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ați capturat ținta?
Comment: 99,0:16:55.25,0:16:58.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Prince 6-3, tu ești responsabil \Nde mutarea Humvee-urilor.
Comment: 99,0:16:55.79,0:16:57.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cum rămâne cu Floarea?
Comment: 99,0:16:57.00,0:16:58.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu știm unde e, domnule.
Comment: 99,0:16:58.79,0:16:59.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,În regulă.
Comment: 99,0:16:59.75,0:17:03.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mergeți cu ținta pe acoperiș \Ncât timp Pandora e încă inactivă.
Comment: 99,0:17:03.21,0:17:04.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Urcați în elicopter și plecați.
Comment: 99,0:17:04.92,0:17:08.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Imediat ce elicopterul decolează, \Ndistrugeți inamicul și clădirea.
Comment: 99,0:17:22.73,0:17:25.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Și i-am spus să nu se \Nîndepărteze de mine...
Comment: 99,0:17:29.24,0:17:31.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,0-2 și 0-8 sunt în poziție.
Comment: 99,0:17:31.87,0:17:33.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Unde este 0-3?
Comment: 99,0:17:33.28,0:17:37.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A trebuit să facă un ocol ca să nu \Nfie detectată. Se apropie de punctul D-2.
Comment: 99,0:17:49.84,0:17:51.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tougetsu!
Comment: 99,0:17:52.89,0:17:55.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Suntem angajați în luptă cu Floarea! \NAvem nevoie de sprijin!
Comment: 99,0:18:10.28,0:18:12.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Am reperat-o! Deschideți focul!
Comment: 99,0:18:12.16,0:18:13.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Este rănită!
Comment: 99,0:18:13.28,0:18:14.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Perfect! Eliminați-o!
Comment: 99,0:18:16.08,0:18:17.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,La naiba! Am fost loviți!
Comment: 99,0:18:17.16,0:18:18.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,De unde?
Comment: 99,0:18:49.78,0:18:50.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fugi!
Comment: 99,0:18:52.70,0:18:53.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ieși pe poarta din spate.
Comment: 99,0:18:53.78,0:18:56.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Există un turn la 500 de metri spre vest.
Comment: 99,0:18:56.49,0:18:57.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Așteaptă-mă acolo!
Comment: 99,0:18:59.62,0:19:00.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,De ce?
Comment: 99,0:19:00.87,0:19:03.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,De ce ești atât de disperată să...
Comment: 99,0:19:03.08,0:19:05.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ți-am spus deja.
Comment: 99,0:19:05.00,0:19:08.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,S-ar putea ca tu să fii \Nsingura noastră speranță.
Comment: 99,0:19:12.55,0:19:13.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Du-te!
Comment: 99,0:19:13.51,0:19:14.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dar...
Comment: 99,0:19:14.47,0:19:15.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Te rog!
Comment: 99,0:19:29.61,0:19:30.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nu pot muri încă.
Comment: 99,0:19:30.65,0:19:32.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Și nici nu-mi doresc să mor.
Comment: 99,0:19:35.61,0:19:37.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mă voi întoarce cu siguranță acasă...
Comment: 99,0:19:39.99,0:19:43.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}și le voi spune mamei, \Ntatei și lui Yuu că totul va fi bine.
Comment: 99,0:19:46.42,0:19:48.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Și mă vor primi cu brațele deschise!
Comment: 99,0:19:59.30,0:20:00.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,La naiba!
Comment: 99,0:20:11.52,0:20:12.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hana...
Comment: 99,0:20:13.74,0:20:15.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Trageți cu rachetele antitanc!
Comment: 99,0:20:15.20,0:20:16.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Suntem mult prea aproape!
Comment: 99,0:20:16.95,0:20:18.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Doar fă-o, la naiba!
Comment: 99,0:20:51.73,0:20:53.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tougetsu!
Comment: 99,0:20:53.61,0:20:54.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dați-mi drumul!
Comment: 99,0:20:54.53,0:20:56.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tougetsu!
Comment: 99,0:20:56.19,0:20:57.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tougetsu!
Comment: 99,0:21:39.61,0:21:41.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Doamne, ce naiba e aia?!
Comment: 99,0:21:46.20,0:21:49.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Către toate unitățile, \Neste Floarea 0-3!
Comment: 99,0:21:49.04,0:21:50.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dați-mi drumul!
Comment: 99,0:21:50.71,0:21:52.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Evitați contactul și retrageți-vă!
Comment: 99,0:21:52.79,0:21:55.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Solicitați USS Mandible să lanseze racheta de croazieră!
Comment: 99,0:21:55.71,0:21:57.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Evacuați-vă imediat!
Comment: 99,0:21:57.38,0:21:58.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Da, domnule!
Comment: 99,0:22:02.59,0:22:04.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hei, ești bine?
Comment: 99,0:22:04.30,0:22:05.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Va trebui să...
Comment: 99,0:22:20.20,0:22:23.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Încă mai pot... continua.
Comment: 99,0:22:23.32,0:22:24.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Eu...
Comment: 99,0:22:31.41,0:22:33.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Anthea...
Comment: 99,0:22:33.54,0:22:36.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Încă... mai pot... continua.
Comment: 99,0:22:36.21,0:22:37.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Eu...
Comment: 99,0:22:44.26,0:22:46.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Anthea!
Comment: 99,0:22:46.30,0:22:49.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ai grijă de Shunichi.
Comment: 99,0:22:49.52,0:22:52.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,T-Te rog, salvează-i pe toți...
Comment: 99,0:22:56.77,0:22:58.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Îmi pare rău...
Comment: 99,0:22:58.36,0:23:00.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Că trebuie să faci mereu \Ntreburile murdare.
Comment: 99,0:23:07.70,0:23:09.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Îți mulțumesc.
Comment: 99,0:23:14.00,0:23:16.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ploaia ar trebui să se \Noprească până diseară.
Comment: 99,0:23:16.17,0:23:18.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Poți vedea soarele \Nieșind dintre nori.
Comment: 99,0:23:18.34,0:23:19.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Da.
Comment: 99,0:23:23.97,0:23:25.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ai suferit destul...
Comment: 99,0:23:26.59,0:23:27.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Îmi pare rău.
Comment: 99,0:23:42.32,0:23:43.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mamă?
Comment: 99,0:23:43.78,0:23:45.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mamă, ce s-a întâmplat?
Comment: 99,0:23:45.61,0:23:46.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mamă?
Comment: 99,0:23:51.08,0:23:52.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Priviți!
Comment: 99,0:24:31.95,0:24:35.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,0-3, aici 0-0. Comunicațiile \Nau fost restabilite.
Comment: 99,0:24:35.00,0:24:38.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Un Tomahawk a fost lansat din \Ngolf către zona misiunii.
Comment: 99,0:24:38.21,0:24:39.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Evacuează-te imediat.
Comment: 99,0:24:39.83,0:24:41.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,0-0, aici 0-3.
Comment: 99,0:24:41.75,0:24:43.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Am obținut informațiile lui 0-6.
Comment: 99,0:24:43.50,0:24:45.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Doresc să continui misiunea lui 0-6.
Comment: 99,0:24:46.88,0:24:48.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ai permisiunea s-o faci.
Comment: 99,0:27:27.13,0:27:28.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tată?
Comment: 99,0:27:38.22,0:27:39.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hana...
Comment: 99,0:27:40.14,0:27:41.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ne-am înșelat din nou.
Comment: 99,0:27:45.73,0:27:46.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Da.
Comment: 99,0:27:46.86,0:27:48.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,La început am crezut că este {\i1}alb{\i0}.
Comment: 99,0:27:48.82,0:27:50.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dar apoi am observat \Nsemne de pandoralizare.
Comment: 99,0:27:50.94,0:27:52.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Așa că am schimbat \Ndiagnosticul în {\i1}negru{\i0}.
Comment: 99,0:27:52.57,0:27:55.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Am pus Floarea să-l elimine.
Comment: 99,0:27:55.11,0:27:57.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu am mai văzut \Nniciodată un asemenea caz.
Comment: 99,0:27:57.45,0:27:59.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Va trebui să facem o \Nanaliză mult mai detaliată.
Comment: 99,0:28:00.33,0:28:01.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vă vom comunica rezultatele.
Comment: 99,0:28:04.29,0:28:08.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Misiunea noastră este \Nsă ucidem lumina omenirii.
Comment: 99,0:28:10.67,0:28:14.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Familiile și prietenii \Nnoștri sunt ținuți ostatici.
Comment: 99,0:28:14.67,0:28:20.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nici eșecul, nici fuga și nici \Nmăcar moartea nu ne pot elibera.
Comment: 99,0:28:22.18,0:28:26.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Misiunea noastră este să ne \Ndistrugem propria speranță.
Comment: 99,0:28:28.98,0:28:31.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}„Dar încă mai există speranță.”
Comment: 99,0:28:31.48,0:28:32.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Asta e ceea ce mi-a spus.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.49,0:00:14.24,DedzuyaSigns,,0,0,0,,{\an7\blur1\bord0\shad0\fscx100\fscy100\pos(1760,605)\p1\c&H000000&}m -1760 -605 l 160 -605 160 475 -1760 475
