Comment: 0,0:03:02.70,0:03:04.21,DedzuyaSigns,,0,0,0,,De ce nu sunt suprins?
Comment: 0,0:03:02.70,0:03:04.21,DedzuyaSigns,,0,0,0,,Oh, da, nu astăzi ar trebui să vină colega cea nouă?
Comment: 0,0:03:02.70,0:03:04.66,DedzuyaSigns,,0,0,0,,Ce? E prima oară când aud asta
Comment: 0,0:03:03.12,0:03:05.12,DedzuyaSigns,,0,0,0,,E foarte drăguță
Comment: 0,0:03:03.62,0:03:05.62,DedzuyaSigns,,0,0,0,,Pare să fie genul meu
Comment: 0,0:03:03.87,0:03:05.83,DedzuyaSigns,,0,0,0,,Tu ce părere ai, Shunichi?
Comment: 0,0:03:04.37,0:03:06.00,DedzuyaSigns,,0,0,0,,Mi se pare o fată normală
Comment: 0,0:03:05.46,0:03:06.00,DedzuyaSigns,,0,0,0,,O voi invita să ia prânzul cu noooiiii
